---
 DESCRIPTION     |   2 +-
 NAMESPACE       |   4 --
 R/credentials.R |  73 +-------------------
 R/fetch.R       | 177 ++----------------------------------------------
 R/pr.R          |  24 +------
 5 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 270 deletions(-)

